======================================================================
CAVEATS
======================================================================
  - r/PSLF posts are tagged 'general_pslf' but contain a profession mix
    that is not measured. Comparing 'r/PSLF most negative' against
    profession-disaggregated buckets is apples-to-oranges.
  - Reddit volume in 2024-2026 is amplified by the 1000-result API cap
    (older posts unreachable). Temporal comparisons across years are
    confounded with data-collection geometry.
  - Pre/post tests are associational, not interrupted time series.
  - SDN-vs-Reddit polarity comparison is confounded with population
    (medical-only on SDN) and post length (longer on SDN).
  - Generic 'loan forgiveness' regex matches now require a PSLF anchor
    within 80 chars (round-2 fix); rejects mass-forgiveness-only posts.

